   "upstreamObservation": "Evaluation-stage Deny with provider-evaluation-error diagnostics.",
   "d3Observation": "Trusted-binding operation failure with no decision and a trusted-binding-unavailable diagnostic.",
   "basis": "The pinned upstream ProviderResolver contract declares Some(Err(_)) undefined behavior for the decision outcome; the reference implementation's deny is its chosen handling, not a semantic guarantee. D3 reports the same non-authorization as an operation failure. No caller data is used on either side.",
